---

This repository holds code and documentation only. The data it reads is SkillCorner's basketball open data
(github.com/SkillCorner/opendata-basketball, MIT licence), downloaded by `courtlab fetch` and never redistributed here.
Vendored in `src/courtlab/viewer/vendor/`: three.js (MIT, `three.LICENSE`) and the Inter typeface (SIL Open Font License 1.1, `inter.LICENSE`).
The body in `src/courtlab/viewer/assets/models/` is Quaternius' "Animated Base Character" (CC0 1.0, `models.LICENSE`); its animation clips
are not used, every pose is generated from the data.
The club crests in `src/courtlab/viewer/assets/crests/` are the trademarks of their clubs, shown only to identify the teams of a game in this
non-commercial research viewer; SkillCorner's mark (`assets/skillcorner.png`, `assets/favicon.png`) is SkillCorner's trademark, shown only to credit
the source of the data. Neither is covered by the licence above nor to be reused from here.
